#--- V5. TOP-BESTSELLER UNIQUES (crutch: only the div-money uniques show, the ------------------
#   rest stay hidden. Base lookup by poe2db + poeshop live aggregate:
#   Temporalis(Silk Robe) ~8-10.5k div | Mageblood(Utility Belt) ~220 div |
#   Headhunter(Heavy Belt) ~33 div | Morior Invictus(Grand Regalia) ~30 div.
#   Runemastered versions share the same base, so they match here too.
